abstract: >-
  Energy-Flow Cosmology (EFC) is a unified thermodynamic framework
  in which a continuous energy-entropy flow field generates the
  structure, dynamics, and cognition of the Universe. The framework
  treats energy flow and entropy as universal variables governing
  the emergence and stability of complex systems, from galactic
  rotation curves to consciousness.
